    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- ODA relevant inputs analysed and addressed
- ODA Challenge Call launched
- Yes (Event management team operationalized
- At least two events organized
- At least 2 COVID and post-COVID initiatives supported 
- Benefit card information system for the employees and volunteers in the COVID-19 system developed
- At least 2 rosters of service providers set up</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- In progress, relevant analyses and reports drafted; pending consultation process with national partners.
- ODA Challenge Call launched, currently in implementation phase.
- Events management team operationalized, two high level events organized in 2021.
- Yes, at least two COVID initiatives supported.
- Benefit card information system for the employees and volunteers in the COVID-19 system developed and operational
- No, rosters to be established in 2022.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. ODA relevant inputs analysed and addressed
1.2. ODA Challenge Call successfully implemented
1.3 Event management team operationalized
1.3.1. At least two events organized
1.4. At least 2 COVID and post-COVID initiatives supported 
1.5. Benefit card information system for the employees and volunteers in the COVID-19 system fully operational
1.6. At least 2 rosters of service providers set up.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. In progress: Law on ODA drafted, pending public debate and adoption procedure (Govt and Parliament)
1.2. Yes. Challenge Call launched in May 2021. UNDP has signed 6 contracts with successful Serbian companies in November 2021, amounting to $ 194,039.17. All 6 initiatives in both Albania and North Macedonia successfully implemented and planned results achieved.
1.3. Yes, event management team operationalized. Different events have ben organized, inter alia:
- Dubai EXPO 2020 - the World Exhibition hosted by Dubai in the United Arab Emirates, from 1 October 2021 &#x2013; 31 March 2022. 
- Wine vision by Open Balkan, the organization of the largest, four-day wine fair in Belgrade within the Open Balkans initiative, from 1&#x2013; 4 Sep 2022.
1.4. Activities related to this target have been merged with other activities, namely &#x2013; promotion of the &#x201c;Our Heroes&#x201d; card and launch of the ODA Challenge Call for COVID solutions, which provided support to a total of 6 solutions.
1.5. Benefit card system &#x201e;Our Heroes&#x201c; established and operational. Over 13,000 cards distributed in 2022.
1.6. Rosters established.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. ODA relevant inputs analyzed and addressed
1.2. ODA Law drafted
1.3 At least two events organized 
1.4 Event management team set up
1.5 At least 5 rosters of service provides set up</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.1. Organized various consultations and provided relevant inputs for ODA Law.
2.1.1. ODA Law is currently drafted and waiting for the additional comments.
3.1.1. Organized Light Festival; Organized workshop on the implementation on new regulations on foreigners in the Republic of Serbia. 
4.1.1. Engaged Event Planning and Organization Associate.
5.1.1. 1 roster of translators in final stage. Other rosters of service were delayed due to COVID.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
